WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.057
Unit two. Germs and Sickness!

2
00:00:04.027 --> 00:00:07.880
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:11.231
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.281 --> 00:00:15.177
Today we learn about Germs and Sickness. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.089 --> 00:00:19.422
Germ. Say it with me. Germ!

6
00:00:22.928 --> 00:00:26.212
Cough. Say it with me. Cough!

7
00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:33.274
Sneeze. Say it with me. Sneeze!

8
00:00:36.771 --> 00:00:40.188
Tissue. Say it with me. Tissue!

9
00:00:43.697 --> 00:00:47.030
Sick. Say it with me. Sick!

10
00:00:50.529 --> 00:00:53.795
Fever. Say it with me. Fever!

11
00:00:57.295 --> 00:01:00.795
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

12
00:01:04.295 --> 00:01:08.095
Medicine. Say it with me. Medicine!

13
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:21.379
Germs can make me sick, so I cover my mouth when I cough or sneeze. I use a tissue and throw it away. If I have a fever, I rest and take medicine from a grown-up.

14
00:01:21.428 --> 00:01:22.659
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.946 --> 00:01:29.163
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.213 --> 00:01:30.363
Sneeze!

17
00:01:31.335 --> 00:01:36.604
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.654 --> 00:01:37.804
Rest!

19
00:01:38.665 --> 00:01:45.468
Did you know? Covering your cough with your elbow, not your hand, helps stop germs from spreading!

20
00:01:45.518 --> 00:01:47.450
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.153 --> 00:01:55.790
Think and answer. What should you do when you cough or sneeze?

22
00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:56.990
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.143 --> 00:02:02.949
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.999 --> 00:02:05.610
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

